lyl Caprylate/Caprate Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil Polyethylene Mica&nbsp;</span></p><p>Polyhydroxystearic Acid Lecithin Behenylcarbamoylpropyl Polysilsesquioxane Tocopherol Ascorbyl Palmitate Citric Acid Rubus Idaeus Leaf Cell Culture May Contain: Titanium Dioxide Ci 77891 Iron Oxides Ci 77491 Iron Oxides Ci 77492 Iron Oxides Ci 77499 Red 30 Lake Ci 73360 Blue 1 Lake Ci 42090 Red 7 Lake Ci 15850 Yellow 5 Lake Ci 19140</p><p><br></p><p>As part of a biomimicry technology system to protect skin, less than 1 percent of silicones found in Baby Cheeks Blush Stick.<br><br><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
